  "content": {
    "title": "党课：十九届六中全会精神解读",
    "source": "党总支",
    "publishDate": "2022-06-02",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"> 2022年6月2日，吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心开展党课，总支部书记唐洪丰同志主讲，全体党员和积极分子参加了会议。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div aria-label=\" 图像 小部件\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<p data-widget=\"image\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img alt=\"\" height=\"410\" src=\"assets/a502d2c6f24e661a4992d4831e1ce4238c2607cd2ae986888780ef7d56a539ec.jpg\" width=\"800\"><span title=\"点击并拖拽以改变尺寸\">​</span></span></p>\n<span style=\"background:url(&quot;https://zhjy.jilinjobs.cn:8080/dist/ckeditor/plugins/widget/images/handle.png&quot;) rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.5); left:0px; top:-15px\"><img height=\"15\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" title=\"点击并拖拽以移动\" width=\"15\"></span></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 唐洪丰书记重点围绕“两个确立”，通过对新民主主义革命时期和社会主义建设时期的历史回顾，以及我国现阶段所面临的国际国内形势、所肩负的历史使命，从“两个确立”的形成、“两个确立”的重大意义以及如何做到“两个确立”三个方面进行了深入分析解读。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div aria-label=\" 图像 小部件\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<p data-widget=\"image\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img alt=\"\" height=\"550\" src=\"assets/7730a1225be92266bf0df898ff9b4deca4d7709331b04554df54461f7f04b9b5.jpg\" width=\"801\"><span title=\"点击并拖拽以改变尺寸\">​</span></span></p>\n<span style=\"background:url(&quot;https://zhjy.jilinjobs.cn:8080/dist/ckeditor/plugins/widget/images/handle.png&quot;) rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.5); left:0px; top:-15px\"><img height=\"15\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" title=\"点击并拖拽以移动\" width=\"15\"></span></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 唐洪丰书记纵横捭阖、深入浅出的分析解读让全体党员对十九届六中全会精神有了进一步理解，更加坚定了忠诚拥护“两个确立”，坚决做到“两个维护”的信念和决心。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<div aria-label=\" 图像 小部件\" contenteditable=\"false\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<p data-widget=\"image\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" src=\"assets/a701b72f79c979ef422f979f29ca5e0fb58b4d6ca59431e51232b10ffea500d9.jpg\" width=\"800\"><span title=\"点击并拖拽以改变尺寸\">​</span></span></p>\n<span style=\"background:url(&quot;https://zhjy.jilinjobs.cn:8080/dist/ckeditor/plugins/widget/images/handle.png&quot;) rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.5); left:0px; top:-15px\"><img height=\"15\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" title=\"点击并拖拽以移动\" width=\"15\"></span></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n                ",
    "externalUrl": null
  },
